visual('grid-target',2,'The grid has equal-sized cells. How many additional cells must be shaded so that exactly 2/3 of the grid is shaded?','3|4|5|10','4','There are 15 cells and 6 are shaded. Two thirds of 15 is 10; shade 10 − 6 = 4 additional cells.','Find the target number of shaded cells, then subtract those already shaded.',{'type':'grids','panels':[{'label':'Grid','rows':3,'cols':5,'shaded':[0,2,5,7,10,12]}]}, {'kind':'numeric','expression':'15*2/3-6','visualCheck':'target'})
visual('grid-combined-whole',3,'The two grids are identical and have equal-sized cells. What fraction of all cells in BOTH grids together is shaded?','1/4|1/3|5/12|2/3','1/3','There are 24 cells altogether. The grids have 3 and 5 shaded cells, for 8 shaded cells. Thus 8/24 = 1/3.','When the question combines two wholes, combine their total cell counts too.',{'type':'grids','panels':[{'label':'U','rows':3,'cols':4,'shaded':[0,5,10]},{'label':'V','rows':3,'cols':4,'shaded':[1,3,4,6,9]}]}, {'kind':'numeric','expression':'(3+5)/(12+12)','visualCheck':'combined'})
visual('grid-unshade',1,'Two currently shaded cells are erased. What fraction of the grid will then remain shaded?','1/8|1/4|3/8|1/2','1/4','Six of the 16 cells are currently shaded. Erasing two leaves 4 shaded cells, and 4/16 = 1/4.','The total number of cells stays the same when shading changes.',{'type':'grids','panels':[{'label':'Grid','rows':4,'cols':4,'shaded':[0,2,5,7,8,13]}]}, {'kind':'numeric','expression':'(6-2)/16','visualCheck':'erase'})
